From b18b928131467a963022f3efcd6bc6352fd07599 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:02:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/20] test(app): trace and trochoidal slot keep Top Z under
 stock over it

A new app test generates a trace and a trochoidal slot with Top Z 2 mm
under the box stock top and pins the levels [18, 15, 12]. Decision item 9
records the material_top field on the two param types.

Refs #2004

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
