From e6eb2805095200190d20305fc1e5a800781bff17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:13:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/20] test(app): regenerate pocket_rest_corners.cl and the
 4-axis example for the Top Z law

Both are regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1 on the merged tree. The
diff against main's version is only the air level at Top Z and the
moves that link to it: the rest corners lose the Z20 pass (84 -> 57
moves), and the 4-axis project loses the first level at its Top Z on
two operations (two stamps change). The program
examples/first-4axis-part.nc is unchanged.

Refs #2004

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
