From 7cb6472cb229282b10f8eca38beeed288539d0ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:34:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 18/20] fix(motion): Face and the vault rim ring keep Top Z
 under stock over it

The review of head eacc74c78 found that Face and the vault rim ring
ignored the stock top. A Face on stock 0..20 with Top Z 18 and a
stepdown of 3 cut [15, 12]: a first bite of 5 mm.

- FaceParams gets the runtime field stock_top (from the setup stock
  top in generate.rs). The staged Face uses cut_levels_under. A stated
  stock top that is not finite is refused.
- The vault rim ring uses cut_levels_under on links.approach.stock_top,
  and under_top is skipped when stock stands over Top Z.
- New pins: motion and app top_z_stock_over (Face, vault), and
  one_descent::the_bore_contour_under_carried_stock_never_rapids_into_it
  for the fresh arm of bore_entry under carried stock. The linear-lead
  Ramp cases also fail on main and are tracked in #2301.

Refs #2004

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
